### Get organization
GET http://localhost:8080/app-user/{{appUserId}}/person/{{personId}}/organization
Authorization: Bearer {{Authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Current User Settings
PUT http://localhost:8080/app-user/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{Authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notifyLogin": false,
  "autoPreviewDocuments": false,
  "notifyShareStart": false,
  "notifyShareAccept": false,
  "notifyShareDecline": false,
  "notifyShareEnd": false,
  "notifyDocComment": false,
  "notifyDocDelete": false,
  "notifyDocAdd": false,
  "notifyDocUpload": true
}

### Update Specific User Settings
PUT http://localhost:8080/app-user/3a377013-9eea-4c42-8ccc-032a1d7e8c9c/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{Authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notifyLogin": false,
  "autoPreviewDocuments": false,
  "notifyShareStart": false,
  "notifyShareAccept": false,
  "notifyShareDecline": true,
  "notifyShareEnd": false,
  "notifyDocComment": false,
  "notifyDocDelete": false,
  "notifyDocAdd": false,
  "notifyDocUpload": false
}